Most important Docker commands for viva

Command	Purpose

docker --version	Check Docker version
docker login	Login to DockerHub
docker build -t ots .	Build image
docker images	List images
docker tag	Give image a repository/tag
docker push	Upload image to DockerHub
docker pull	Download image
docker run	Create and start container
docker ps	Show running containers
docker ps -a	Show all containers
docker logs	View container logs
docker stop	Stop container
docker start	Start stopped container
docker restart	Restart container
docker rm	Remove container
docker rmi	Remove image


For your Set-2 practical, the key flow is:
Maven WAR → Dockerfile → docker build → docker tag → docker push → docker run -p 8080:8080 → browser.
